桌面端 LOGO:
- icon.png: Hermes mock → 真 1024×1024 白字毛笔文枢 PNG (290 KB)
- icon.icns: Hermes PNG mock → 真 ic12 macOS 11+ 多尺寸 (449 KB, 16/32/64/128/256/512/1024)
- icon.ico: Hermes PNG mock → 真 6 尺寸 ICO (454 KB, 16/32/48/64/128/256)
- apple-touch-icon.png: Hermes mock → 180×180 (11.5 KB)
- 来源: ~/Desktop/文枢-{反白,透明背景}.png 抠图+居中+12% padding

installer 独立化 (避免污染 ~/.hermes):
- hermes_constants.py: 默认 HERMES_HOME 改 ~/.wenshu-hermes
- main.ts: 强制 set HERMES_HOME (5 行)
- package.json mac.extendInfo.LSEnvironment: 注入 HERMES_HOME
- bootstrap-installer paths.rs: 默认 fallback 改 ~/.wenshu-hermes
- bootstrap-installer update.rs: 注释改 文枢 Setup
- bootstrap-installer Cargo.toml: name=wenshu-setup, authors=文枢 Project, bin=文枢-Setup, [lib] edition=2021 (修 async fn 错)
- install.sh/ps1/cmd + setup-hermes.sh: 默认 repo 改 ZIYU-FUI/wenshu, 默认 HERMES_HOME 改 ~/.wenshu-hermes, URL 改 raw.githubusercontent.com/ZIYU-FUI/wenshu

Co-authored-by: hermes-agent <noreply@NousResearch>
